{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/rukan-maison-lmd-developers-wadi-al-safa","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":231,"crm_id":"2865","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Rukan Maison","slug":"rukan-maison-lmd-developers-wadi-al-safa","display_address":"Wadi Al Safa","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"LMD Developers","price":582687,"display_price":"582K","lattitude":25.042141,"longitude":55.2877087,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Rukan Maison Tower C is the third tower of the Rukan Maison residential complex, located in the Rukan Community area by the developer LMD. This is a modern building that combines the vibrant, contemporary style of the West and the traditional beauty and tranquillity of the East. High-quality facades, distinctive architectural design in neutral colours, which perfectly blend with the surrounding nature, form a harmonious combination of elegance and functionality. The complex offers <strong>studios and apartments with 1 and 2 bedrooms</strong>, equipped with large balconies or terraces. The elegance of the interiors is complemented by cozy furniture and panoramic windows that fill each apartment with natural light, creating a unique atmosphere.</p><p>Residents of the complex can enjoy a family-friendly environment served by first-class amenities. The project area includes a swimming pool, children's playground, jogging paths, recreation areas and much more.</p><p>The convenient location of Rukan Maison Tower C in Wadi Al Safa provides residents with easy access to other key areas. With its proximity to the main roads of Dubai, the whole city is within reach. Global Village is just 5 minutes away, Miracle Garden is 15 minutes away, and Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa, Expo 2020, Mall of The Emirates and International Airport are all within 20-25 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/SmIVNCfnsdskR4JcYN2iKSJMGAY74ZHwICi29C0G.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/SmIVNCfnsdskR4JcYN2iKSJMGAY74ZHwICi29C0G.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/3owFl2Zzwir5put0vjoc49CW5gOufl1EVgR71TxR.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/3owFl2Zzwir5put0vjoc49CW5gOufl1EVgR71TxR.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/pPGXedihsRbA4SXNzrXex0OlZZJ1ICKmuTV69kiG.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/pPGXedihsRbA4SXNzrXex0OlZZJ1ICKmuTV69kiG.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/n6G4QHt39AFkO308LVMVxpZB00Hlfa50pyAd1Q0c.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/n6G4QHt39AFkO308LVMVxpZB00Hlfa50pyAd1Q0c.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/JVHDerClrlvUE6MlzqgmsvFvmT8mCCSEr37Z8yMB.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/JVHDerClrlvUE6MlzqgmsvFvmT8mCCSEr37Z8yMB.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/HZScO5FZrWU3PDe7GhZd6yMU3ewR2u0YtbxT2sWT.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/HZScO5FZrWU3PDe7GhZd6yMU3ewR2u0YtbxT2sWT.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/rF8mA5b4KJ3ayU1ykV4driRtdR2pVTLIrxrD0Ypq.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/08/22/rF8mA5b4KJ3ayU1ykV4driRtdR2pVTLIrxrD0Ypq.jpg","__ggfxIndex":6},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2865/images/2024/08/22/HHMZpDPOa